{"resource": {"name": "College and Career Outcomes of High School Graduates", "id": "vj54-j4q3", "resource_name": null, "parent_fxf": [], "description": "This dataset provides the number of graduates who enrolled in each type of postsecondary education per district.\n\nWage records are obtained from the Massachusetts Department of Unemployment Assistance (DUA) using a secure, anonymized matching process with limitations. For details on the process and suppression rules, please visit the <a href=\"https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiODA3NDU1NWMtOTJiMS00YTZiLTg1MmEtN2JhOTM4ZjNmNWExIiwidCI6IjNlODYxZDE2LTQ4YjctNGEwZS05ODA2LThjMDRkODFiN2IyYSJ9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Employment and Earnings of High School Graduates dashboard</a>.\n\nThis dataset is one of three containing the same data that is also published in the <a href=\"https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiODA3NDU1NWMtOTJiMS00YTZiLTg1MmEtN2JhOTM4ZjNmNWExIiwidCI6IjNlODYxZDE2LTQ4YjctNGEwZS05ODA2LThjMDRkODFiN2IyYSJ9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Employment and Earnings of High School Graduates dashboard</a>:\n<a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/Finance-and-Budget/Wage-Dashboard-Average-Earnings-by-Student-Group/9vfm-6vxq/about_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Average Earnings by Student Group</a>\n<a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/Finance-and-Budget/Wage-Dashboard-Average-Annual-Earnings-by-Industry/wxc8-6an4/about_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Average Earnings by Industry</a>\n<a href=\"https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/College-and-Career/Wage-Dashboard-College-and-Career-Outcomes/vj54-j4q3/about_data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">College and Career Outcomes</a>\n\n<b>List of Outcomes</b>\n<ul><li>Total Postsecondary Enrollment</li><li>In-State Public 2-Year</li><li>In-State Public 4-Year</li><li>In-State Private</li><li>Out-of-State</li><li>Total Employed</li><li>Total Missing</li></ul>", "attribution": "Executive Office of Education", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2024-03-27T17:58:55.000Z", "createdAt": "2023-06-02T19:51:33.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2024-03-27T17:58:55.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2023-07-13T20:47:39.000Z", "columns_name": ["HS_GRAD_YEAR", "OUTCOME_TYPE", "OUTCOME_YEAR", "OUTCOME_CNT", "DIST_NAME", "DIST_CODE", "GRAD_CNT"], "columns_field_name": ["hs_grad_year", "outcome_type", "outcome_year", "outcome_count", "district_name", "district_code", "grad_count"], "columns_datatype": ["Text", "Text", "Text", "Number", "Text", "Text", "Number"], "columns_description": ["High School Graduation Year", "Outcome Type", "Outcome Year", "Outcome Count", "District Name", "District Code", "Graduated Count"], "columns_format": [{"decimalSeparator": ".", "noCommas": "true", "groupSeparator": ","}, {}, {"decimalSeparator": ".", "noCommas": "true", "groupSeparator": ","}, {"decimalSeparator": ".", "groupSeparator": ","}, {}, {"decimalSeparator": ".", "groupSeparator": ","}, {"decimalSeparator": ".", "groupSeparator": ","}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "locked": false, "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2023-06-16T20:32:09.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_category": "College and Career", "domain_tags": ["career", "college", "earnings", "graduation", "university", "wage"], "domain_metadata": [{"key": "Update_Update-Frequency", "value": "Biannually"}]}, "metadata": {"domain": "educationtocareer.data.mass.gov"}, "permalink": "https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/d/vj54-j4q3", "link": "https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/College-and-Career/College-and-Career-Outcomes-of-High-School-Graduat/vj54-j4q3", "owner": {"id": "m5tk-n3hd", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "E2C Hub"}, "creator": {"id": "m5tk-n3hd", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "E2C Hub"}}
{"resource": {"name": "Educator Preparation Program Completers", "id": "vrmj-6h37", "resource_name": null, "parent_fxf": [], "description": "This dataset shows the number of candidates who completed an <a href=\"https://www.doe.mass.edu/edprep/directory.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">approved Massachusetts educator preparation program</a> by institution, license level, and the type of program completed since 2011. It includes the total number of candidates meeting all requirements of the preparation program (i.e., instruction/course work and practicum), regardless of whether a candidate has taken and passed state tests or assessments for licensure or has been endorsed for licensure by the program.\n\nNote: \"All Program Completers\" may double count candidates who completed two programs during the same year.\n\nThis dataset contains the same data that is also published on our DESE Profiles site:\n<a href=\"https://profiles.doe.mass.edu/statereport/epppprogramcompleters.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ed Prep Program Completers</a>", "attribution": "Department of Elementary and Secondary Education", "attribution_link": "https://www.doe.mass.edu", "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2024-07-30T17:36:33.000Z", "createdAt": "2024-07-23T18:43:18.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2024-07-30T17:36:30.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2024-07-30T17:36:33.000Z", "columns_name": ["PRGRM_CMPLTR_CNT", "PRGRM_NAME", "SY", "ORG_NAME", "ORG_CODE", "PRGRM_LIC_LVL"], "columns_field_name": ["prgrm_cmpltr_cnt", "prgrm_name", "sy", "org_name", "org_code", "prgrm_lic_lvl"], "columns_datatype": ["Number", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text", "Text"], "columns_description": ["Program Completer Count", "Program Name", "School Year", "Organization Name", "Organization Code", "Program License Level"], "columns_format": [{}, {}, {}, {}, {}, {}], "provenance": "official", "lens_view_type": "tabular", "lens_display_type": "table", "locked": false, "blob_mime_type": null, "hide_from_data_json": false, "publication_date": "2024-07-30T17:23:54.000Z"}, "classification": {"categories": [], "tags": [], "domain_category": "Students and Teachers", "domain_tags": ["administrators", "apprenticeship", "ed prep", "educator preparation", "educators", "performance review program for initial licensure", "prpil", "specialists", "support", "teachers"], "domain_metadata": [{"key": "Update_Update-Frequency", "value": "Annually"}, {"key": "Geospatial-Details_Coverage", "value": "Statewide"}]}, "metadata": {"domain": "educationtocareer.data.mass.gov"}, "permalink": "https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/d/vrmj-6h37", "link": "https://educationtocareer.data.mass.gov/Students-and-Teachers/Educator-Preparation-Program-Completers/vrmj-6h37", "owner": {"id": "m5tk-n3hd", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "E2C Hub"}, "creator": {"id": "m5tk-n3hd", "user_type": "interactive", "display_name": "E2C Hub"}}
{"resource": {"name": "Arts Course Taking", "id": "w3f3-phkq", "resource_name": null, "parent_fxf": [], "description": "This dataset contains the number and percentage of Massachusetts public school students completing at least one arts course in grades K-12 since 2018. Arts courses are reported in the Student Course Schedule (SCS) system and align with the <a href=\"https://www.doe.mass.edu/instruction/arts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Massachusetts Arts Curriculum Framework</a>. For a full list of courses and subjects, see the <a href=\"https://profiles.doe.mass.edu/help/ArtsCourseLookup.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Arts Course List</a>.\n\nBeginning with the 2019-2020 school year, the arts course list was updated the \"Media Arts\" category. In addition, a number of arts courses were reclassified from the \"General Arts\" category to \"Visual Arts\" to more closely align to the industry standard. Since 2022, courses are no longer assigned to the \"General\" category.\n\nEconomically Disadvantaged was used 2015-2021. Low Income was used prior to 2015, and a different version of Low Income has been used since 2022. Please see the <a href=\"https://www.doe.mass.edu/research/researchers.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DESE Researcher's Guide</a> for more information.\n\nThis dataset contains the same data that is also published on our DESE Profiles site:\n<a href=\"https://profiles.doe.mass.edu/statereport/artcourse.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Arts Coursetaking Report</a>", "attribution": "Department of Elementary and Secondary Education", "attribution_link": null, "contact_email": null, "type": "dataset", "updatedAt": "2024-07-12T17:48:30.000Z", "createdAt": "2024-01-10T22:04:30.000Z", "metadata_updated_at": "2024-07-12T17:48:30.000Z", "data_updated_at": "2024-05-13T15:11:20.000Z", "columns_name": ["G10_CNT", "G12_PCT", "G11_PCT", "G10_PCT", "G09_PCT", "G08_PCT", "G07_PCT", "G06_